喜歡\n下次點更硬試試看😋\n湯頭順口且濃郁\n溏心蛋非常優秀\n肉都滿好吃的\n\n驚艷的是免費加麵\n來的一碗麵上還有肉\n是不是太有誠意\n整頓吃下來滿足又飽足",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6280102188131553471/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhOZVZReE9VTldNRVV6WW5wc2RWZFZhekpqVXpGb1lqTk9URmRGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,26281,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd27bfb438c30b04a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlMyT19CV0E3bzluWUk2cS1hb3NLWEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xNeVQxOUNWMEUzYnpsdVdVazJjUzFoYjNOTFdFRRILMGUwamotRVBVQVAaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sTXlUMTlDVjBFM2J6bHVXVWsyY1MxaGIzTkxXRUUSCzBlMGpqLUVQVUFQIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARSrAwjEP7e9IqCzBlMGpqLUVQVUFQ\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026